{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vP1hdjGnpP1794200008.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產新達廣場資深分區營業經理趙愛蓮表示，近期租賃交投暢旺，大埔新晉屋苑上然最新錄7座中層B2室，單位實用面積470平方呎，2房間隔，議價後以18,500元租出，實用平均呎租約39.4元。<br/>中原趙愛蓮表示，新租客為區內客，見屋苑樓齡新，環境舒適，間隔合用，租金合理，即決定租入單位自用。據了解，業主於2025年以573萬元購入單位，是次租出單位可享3.9厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.029430+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:54:57.402041+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.470483+00:00","content_hash":"e129e23c6f81a28a0f66a96ff13d5a72f0af65040f4f4df2e5aa5b8397454529","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.029430+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}